  "reference": "Egetabu ki’Emebeyano 5",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokuurerwa gw’okwanga obonyaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, tegerera oigwe obong’aini bwane! Igwera okomanya kw’ane!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nario oramanye korenda ebirengererio biao, na ebikoba biao birende chiseemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikoba bi’omokuungu omonyaka nigo bigotonyia ayaare amansu buna obooke, na omonwa oye nigo ore omoterere kobua amaguta akweakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omoerio bw’omokuungu oyio nigo ore omoororo buna ekemeri ekeroro, na omwoge buna omoyio o birende otieririe chinsemo chionsi ibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagoro aye nigo akoraa gochia ase amakweri, na ogotacha kwaye kwaraa gochia aase abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere tari gotaara enchera ekogeenda ase obogima; orogendo rw’aye nigo rokona‐koonchaonchoka, ere tamanyeti ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, inwe abana bane, ’ntegerere; timobaisa gotiga amang’ana ane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erende obeere aare korwa ase omokungu oyio; tobaisa goika ang’e negesieri ki’enyomba yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oise gokora bo, nigo orae abanto abaao amasikani ao, na emiaka yao ebaise konachwa n’abanto batari n’amaabera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende abanto abaao nigo baraire chinibo chiao chionsi, na bionsi ebi gwakoreire emeremo biirwe nabaanto abwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoerio oye norere, obokie amagombo ekero chinyama chi’omobere oo chiaerire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’noteebe, “Inaki nakorete ’nkageecha ogokuurerwa, na enkoro y’ane egachaaya okorongeigwa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinaigwerete amorokererio yaborokia bane, gose tinategererete koigwera abarenge konyorokereria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo nabeete ang’e gosira ase obosooku kegima bosio bw’omogaanda ondigereretie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanywe amaache okobucha korwa ase egesima kiao, na aya agosoka korwa ase ensoko yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Chinsooko chiao ’nchigwenerete gwesiarera gochia aare, ne chindooche chiao chi’amaache ase chiinchera?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga chinsoko echio chibe echiao aye bweka na tari echi’abaanto abaao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga ensoko yao esesenigwe, naye ogookere omokungu bw’oboke bwao,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oyore buna ensune eyanchire na buna engabi ensiani. Tiga obosiani bwaye bokong’use, na ogokigwe nere chingaki chionsi. Obwanchani bwaye tiga bokogokie kogeenderera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, nase ki okogokigwa nomokuungu omonyaka? Nase ki okoboania omokungu bw’omonto omoao?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinchera chi’omonto nigo chirorekanete maiso marore ase Omonene, n’Omonene nigo arigereretie ogokora kwaye gwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibe bi’omokori amabe nigo bikomobwata omonyene; nasibwe ne chingori chire ebibe biaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio nigo arakwe, ekiagera angete ogokuurerwa, na ase engencho y’oboriri bwaye obonene ’nasire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
